# deploy/postgres/pg_ident.conf.template
# Rendered verbatim to /etc/postgresql/18/main/pg_ident.conf on the VPS, next to pg_hba.conf.
# One map, used by exactly one pg_hba line (`local debateai debateai_staff_readiness_writer peer
# map=readiness`): the OS user root may log in as the password-less staff readiness writer of
# migration 0109, and nothing else. No other OS user, no other database role. No trailing
# comments: tests/architecture/vps-deployment-baseline.test.ts parses every non-comment line.
#
# MAPNAME     SYSTEM-USERNAME   PG-USERNAME
readiness     root              debateai_staff_readiness_writer
